<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Ngoni Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Vaebulania</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua kwa Vaebulania</para>
  <para style="toc2">Vaebulania</para>
  <para style="toc3">Vaeb</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Vaebulania</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Vaebulania ndi balua yeyikangamalisa vandu mitima yeyilangisa kuvya Yesu Cheatimalisi Mayandiku ndalindali ga ulota wa Lilaganu la Kadeni. Balua ya Vaebulania yiyandikwi ngati malovi ga makokosu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kavili mugati ya balua ya Vaebulania kuvi na mistali neju ya 60 muchitabu ichi. Pauli ajovili kuhuma mu lilaganu la kadeni yeyilangisa hotohoto kuvya Yesu cheatimalisi ulota woha na lihengu laki la kuvya Mteta Mkulu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kangi ndava yeniyo, chitabu chenichi chaganikiwi kuvakanagamalisa mitima Vakilisitu vevavi Vayawudi. Balua ya Vaebulania yilangisa kuvya Yesu cheatimlisi Malagizu muni Vamteta va Chapanga vakotoka kuvya kavili na njila ya kuvika luteta. Yesu avi luteta lwelawusili kumbudila Chapanga kwoha, kutumbula lukumbi peafwili pamsalaba na hati magono goha gangali mwishu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mewa Vakilisitu vevitama mu magono gitu ga lelu mewawa vihotola kukangamaliswa mitima na balua yeniyi ya Vaebulania muni vayendelelayi kumsadika Yesu Kilisitu ndava muni ndi ngamwene mweakutihotosa tete timuhuvalila Chapanga (musula ya 12:2).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mewawa kawaka mundu mweamanyili yani neju muuchakaka ndi mweayandiki balua iyi kwa Vaebulania, nambu vasomi wa mambu ga chibibilia vajovili kuvya ndi mmoja pagati ya vadatu hava, yani Mtumi Pauli, Luka amala Balinaba.</para>
  <para style="ip">Talehe ya kuyandikwa balua yeniyi mewa yimanyikana lepi, nambu vamahele va vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu visadika kuvya kwakona mwaka 70 Yesu Kilisitu peavelekiwi. Nambu myandika wa balua yeniyi ilongelela muji wa Yelusalemu ngati kuvya wavili wakona kugwisiwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hinu balua kwa Vaebulania yayandikwi pamuji wa ku Loma (musula ya 13:24). Na yihotoleka kuvya yatindiswi muni yisomwayi mu msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu ndalindali.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavi</para>
  <para style="io">Muyandika akumlangisa Yesu Kilisitu kuvya ndi mkulu neju kuliku vamlota va Chapanga na vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga (musula ya 1:1-4:13).</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi iyendelela kulangisa kuvya Yesu ndi mkulu neju kuliku vamteta va Chapanga vevihenga lihengu mugati ya Nyumba ya Chapanga ya ku Yelusalemu (musula za 4:14-7:28). Mewa ilangisa kuvya lihengu la Yesu ndi yabwina neju kuliku Malagizu ga Chapanga yeampelili Musa (musula za 8:1-10:31).</para>
  <para style="io">Peamali kudandaula kuvya Yesu ndi neju na mkulu munamuna zoha, hinu muyandika iyendelela kujova malagizu gegiganikiwa kuhengewa lihengu ndava ya kutama (musula za 10:32-13:17).</para>
  <para style="io">Pamwishu muyandika imalakisila mukuyandika balua yaki kwa kujova kangamalisa na jambusa (musula ya 13:18-25).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1"/>
  <para style="s">Lilovi la Chapanga kwa njila ya Mwana waki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1"/>Penapo kadeni Chapanga ajovili na vagogo vitu pamahele munjila ya vamlota va Chapanga na kwa namuna ndalindali. <verse eid="HEB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2"/>Nambu magono aga ga mwishu, ajovili na tete munjila ya Mwana waki. Chapanga ndi mweapelili vindu vyoha kuvya vyaki, mewa ndi yuyoyo mweawumbili mulima woha. <verse eid="HEB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3"/>Mwene ndi atilangasili ukulu wa Chapanga, na luhumu chakaka lwa Chapanga. Mwene ikamulila mulima kwa lilovi laki lelivi na makakala. Peamali lihengu la kuvakita vandu vahuma mukubumdila Chapanga kwavi, atamili kunani kwa Chapanga muchiwoko cha kulyelela wa Chapanga Mkulu.<verse eid="HEB 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Mwana wa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4"/>Mwana ndi mkulu neju kuliku vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga, ndava muni apewili liina likulu na Chapanga kuliku mahina gavi. <verse eid="HEB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5"/>Ndava muni Chapanga amjovili lepi katu hati mmonga wa vamitumu vaki va kunani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">“Veve ndi Mwana vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">nene lelu nivii Dadi waku.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Mewa ajovili lepi mtumu yeyoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">“Nene yati nivya Dadi waki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">namwene yati ivya Mwana vangu.”<verse eid="HEB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6"/>Nambu Chapanga peamtumili Mwana waki, mvelekewa wa kutumbula pamulima ajovili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:6">“Vamitumu voha va Chapanga na vamgundamila.”<verse eid="HEB 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7"/>Nambu Mayandiku Gamsopi yiyandikwi kuvya mundu ijova malovi kuvavala vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:7">“Chapanga avahengili vamitumu vaki kuvya mpungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:7">na vanalihengu vaki ndimi za motu.”<verse eid="HEB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8"/>Nambu kumvala Mwana, Chapanga ajovili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:8">“Unkosi waku veve mewawa ndi mweuvili Chapanga yati wilongosa magono na magono goha gangali mwishu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:8">Veve wilongosa vandu vaku kwa njila ya kumganisa Chapanga.<verse eid="HEB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9"/>Veve wigana mambu gegavi gabwina palongolo ya Chapanga na kugayomela gahakau.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">Ndi muni Chapanga, Chapanga waku akuhagwili</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">na kukusopa mahuta ga luheku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">na kukupela utopesa uvaha kuliku vayaku voha.”<verse eid="HEB 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10"/>Mewawa Chapanga ajovili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:10">“Veve Bambu penapo pakutumbula wawumbili mulima woha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:10">kwa mawoko gaku wawumbili kunani kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="HEB 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11"/>Zenizo yati zimalika, nambu veve yati usigalila magono goha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:11">zoha yati zilala ngati nyula.<verse eid="HEB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12"/>Yati ukuzihinyana ngati likoti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">na zene yati zing'anamuswa ngati nyula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">Nambu veve ndi yulayula magono goha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">na wumi waku wivya lepi na mwishu.”<verse eid="HEB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13"/>Chapanga katu, amjovili lepi mtumu wa kunani yeyoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:13">“Tamaa ulongosa na nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:13">mbaka nivavika makoko vaku pahi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:13">ngati chigoda cha kuvikila magendelu?”<verse eid="HEB 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14"/>Wu, vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga ndi vayani? Hinu vene ndi mpungu weukumuhengela Chapanga na vevitumwa nayu ndava ya kuvatangatila vandu vevipokela usangula.<verse eid="HEB 1:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2"/>
  <para style="s">Usangula ukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1"/>Ndava yeniyo yikutigana neju kugakamula neju uchakaka wetiuyuwini, muni tikotoka kuyaga. <verse eid="HEB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2"/>Ujumbi wula wewajoviwi na vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga walolikini kuvya chakaka, hati mundu yeyoha mweaulandili lepi amala kuyidakila abuniwi ngati cheyaganikiwi. <verse eid="HEB 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3"/>Tete tihotola wuli kulama ngati tikuusadika lepi usangula mkulu ngati uwu? Hoti Bambu ajovili usangula uwu, kangi vala vevauyuwini chakaka. <verse eid="HEB 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4"/>Mewawa Chapanga alangisi kuvya chakaka kwa kukita ulangisu ndalindali ya makangaso na gachinamtiti mu njila ya Mpungu Msopi kwa kuvapela vandu hipanji ngati cheaganili mwene.<verse eid="HEB 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi mweatilongwisi mu usangula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5"/>Chapanga avavikili lepi vamitumu kulongosa mulima weubwela, ndi mulima wula wetikuulongelela malovi gaki. <verse eid="HEB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6"/>Nambu mu Mayandiku Gamsopi pandu pangi gijova kuvya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">“Wu, mundu ndi yani hati umuhololelayi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">Wu, Mwana wa mundu ndi yani hati umyangalila?<verse eid="HEB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7"/>Umhengili kuvya mdebe pahi ya vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:7">umuwaliki njingwa na ukulu na utopesa.<verse eid="HEB 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8"/>Na veve uvikili vindu vyoha pahi ya magendelu gaki”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Yijovekana kuvya Chapanga amukitili kuvya chilongosi panani ya vindu vyoha ndi changali kuleka hati chindu chimonga. Pamonga hinu naha tilola lepi kuvya apewili uhotola panani ya vindu vyoha. <verse eid="HEB 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9"/>Nambu tikumlola Yesu mweavikiwi palukumbi kuvya pandu padebe kuliku vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga, muni kwa ubwina wa Chapanga afwayi ndava ya vandu voha. Na hinu tikumlola awalikwi njwinga ya ukulu na utopesa kwa lifwa leang'aikili. <verse eid="HEB 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10"/>Ndava ya kuvaleta vana vamahele mu ukulu waki, yamganisi Chapanga mweiwumba na kuyunga vindu vyoha amkamilisa Yesu Kilisitu mu njila ya mang'ahiso. Ndava Yesu ndi chilongosi mkulu wa usangula.<verse eid="HEB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11"/>Mwene avanyambisa vandu vevakumbudila Chapanga, mwene na vala vevinyambiswa, voha vivya na Dadi mmonga. Ndava yeniyo Yesu ikola lepi soni kuvakemela vandu avo valongo vaki. <verse eid="HEB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12"/>Cheijova kwa Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:12">“Veve Chapanga yati nikulikokosa liina laku kwa valongo vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:12">yati nikuyimbila lunyimbu lwa kukulumba pagati ya mngonganu wavi.”<verse eid="HEB 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13"/>Mewawa ijova, “Yati nikumvikila huvalila Chapanga.” Na kangi ijova, “Nene nivii penapa pamonga na vana veanipeli Chapanga vavyai vana vangu.”<verse eid="HEB 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14"/>Hinu, ndava muni vana avo ndi vandu vevavi na higa na ngasi, mewawa Yesu abwelili muni avyai ngati vene akahanganila muumundu wavi. Akitili chenicho muni mu njila ya lifwa, amhotola Setani mweavili na makakala ndava ya lifwa, <verse eid="HEB 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15"/>na mewa muni avalekekesa vala vevavi vavanda muwumi wavi woha, ndava ya kuyogopa lifwa. <verse eid="HEB 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16"/>Muni chakaka kuvya mwene abwelili lepi ndava ya kuvatangatila vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga, nambu kuvatangatila chiveleku cha Ibulahimu. <verse eid="HEB 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17"/>Ndi muni yamganili abwela avyai ngati vandu vangi chevavili mukila chindu, muni avyai Mteta Mkulu wavi mweavi msadikika na lipyana mukumhengela Chapanga, muni kumbudila Chapanga kwa vandu kulekekeswai. <verse eid="HEB 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18"/>Ndava mwene anga'aiswi pala pealingiwa, ahotola kuvatangatila vala vevilingiwa.<verse eid="HEB 2:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi Mkulu kuliku Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1"/>Ndava yeniyo, valongo vangu, vandu vemkemiwi na Chapanga, mhololela Yesu mweatumwili na Chapanga avyayi Mteta Mkulu wa sadika yetijova tikuyisadika kwa milomo yitu. <verse eid="HEB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2"/>Mwene avili msadikika kwa Chapanga mweamhagwili kuhenga lihengu laki ngati Musa cheavili msadikika mu kuvahengela vandu voha Chapanga, vevakemiwi nyumba ya Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3"/>Nambu Yesu iganikiwa utopesa neju kuliku Musa ngati mjengaji wa nyumba cheipata utopesa neju kuliku nyumba yene. <verse eid="HEB 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4"/>Nyumba yeyoha yijengwa na mundu nunuyu, nambu Chapanga ndi mjengaji wa vindu vyoha. <verse eid="HEB 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5"/>Musa avili muhengaji msadikika kwa vandu voha va Chapanga, vevakemiwi nyumba ya Chapanga. Ajovili kugavala mambu, Chapanga geakugajova kulongolo. <verse eid="HEB 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6"/>Nambu Kilisitu avili msadikika ngati Mwana munyumba ya Chapanga. Tete ndi nyumba ya Chapanga ngati tiyendelelela kuvya vakekesi na kumekela chila chetihuvalila.<verse eid="HEB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kupumulila kwa vandu va Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7"/>Ndava muni, ngati cheijova Mpungu Msopi mu Mayandiku Gamsopi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:7">“Lelu mukayuwana lwami lwa Chapanga,<verse eid="HEB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8"/>mkoto kukita mitima yinu yinonopa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">ngati vagogo vinu pevanibelili kuniyidakila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">lukumbi lula pevanilingili kulugangatu.<verse eid="HEB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9"/>Kwenuko vagogo vinu vanilingili na kunilingulila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:9">pamonga valolili matendu gangu pa miyaka alobaini!<verse eid="HEB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10"/>Ndava yeniyo nachiyomili chiveleku chenicho najovili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">‘Vandu ava vibuda mumitima yavi magono goha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">vilanda lepi njila zangu.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11"/>Hinu, nilapa kwa ligoga langu kuvya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:11">‘Viyingila lepi katu pandu pa kupumulila.’ ”<verse eid="HEB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12"/>Hinu valongo vangu, mjiyangalila mumitima yinu akotoka kuvya mundu pagati yinu mweavi na mtima uhakau wangasadika, weukujibagula na Chapanga mweavi mumi. <verse eid="HEB 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13"/>Nambu mkangamalisanayi mtima, lelikemelewa “Lelu” Yeyisomwa mu Mayandiku kila ligono, muni akotoka kuvya hati mmonga pagati yinu mweavi na mtima unonopo kwa kukongiwa na kuvya mndindani. <verse eid="HEB 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14"/>Ndava muni tete tiwungana na Kilisitu, yikavya tikamulana na huvalila ya chakaka yetavili nayu kuhumila kutumbula mbaka mwishu.<verse eid="HEB 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15"/>Ngati Mayandiku Gamsopi chegijova,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">“Ngati mwiyuwana lwami lwa Chapanga lelu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">Mitima yinu yikoto kunonopa, ngati chevakitili vagogo vinu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">pavabelili kumyidakila Chapanga.”<verse eid="HEB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16"/>Hinu, vandu voki vevayuwini lwami lwa Chapanga na kubela kumyidakila? Wu, lepi vala voha vevalongwisi na Musa kuhuma mulima wa ku Misili? <verse eid="HEB 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17"/>Chapanga avayomili vayani mumiyaka alobaini? Avayomili vandu vala vevambudili Chapanga? Na mituhi yavi yadandasiki kulugangatu. <verse eid="HEB 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18"/>Kangi Chapanga pealapili avajovili vayani kuvya, “Katu yati viyingila lepi pamulima wangu na kupumulila,” Avajovayi vandu vevabelili kumyidakila? <verse eid="HEB 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19"/>Hinu, tilola kuvya vahotwili lepi kuyingili kwenuko, ndava ya kubela kusamdika Chapanga.<verse eid="HEB 3:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1"/>Hinu, ndava Chapanga atipeli lilagizi ya kupokela pumulilo na tijiyangalila muni hati mmonga winu, angahotola kupata pumulilo lenilo. <verse eid="HEB 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2"/>Ndava muni tete mewawa tikokosiwi Lilovi la Bwina ngati chevakokosiliwi vandu va kadeni, vayuwini lilovi nambu yavatangatili lepi chindu, muni vala vevayuwini vaupokili lepi kwa sadika. <verse eid="HEB 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3"/>Nambu, tete vetisadika tipata pumulilo lenilo lealagizi Chapanga. Ngati cheajovili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">“Penalapili mu ligoga langu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">‘Kuvya katu yati viyingila lepi pandu pangu pa pumulilo.’ ”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Chapanga ajovili ago pamonga lihengu yaki amali kuyimala kutumbula peawumbili mulima. <verse eid="HEB 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4"/>Muni Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova pandu nunuyu ndava ya ligono la saba, “Chapanga apumulili ligono la saba, alekili mahengu gaki goha.” <verse eid="HEB 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5"/>Kangi lijambu lenili lijoviwi mewa, “Viyingila lepi katu pamulima wenikuvapela vapumulila.” <verse eid="HEB 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6"/>Vandu vala vevayuwini hoti Lilovi la Bwina vapokili lepi pumulilo lenilo, ndava vabeli kuyidakila, nambu leajovili Chapanga lakona livili kwa vangi kupumulila. <verse eid="HEB 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7"/>Nambu Chapanga avikili ligono lingi lelikemelewa “Lelu,” Akajova miyaka yamahele mwanakandahi mu njila ya Daudi malovi gegamali kuluwuliwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:7">“Ngati myuwana lwami lwa Chapanga lelu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:7">mkoto kukita mitima yinu yinonopa.”<verse eid="HEB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8"/>Ngati Yoshua avapelili vandu avo pumulilo lenilo, Chapanga ngaajovili lepi ndava ya ligono lingi. <verse eid="HEB 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9"/>Ndava yeniyo, kupumulila kwa vandu va Chapanga kwakona kuvili, ngati Chapanga cheapumulili ligono la saba. <verse eid="HEB 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10"/>Muni, kila mweiyingila pandu pa pumulilo leajovili Chapanga yati ipumulila kuhuma mulihengu laki ngati mewa Chapanga cheapumulili kuhuma mulihengu laki. <verse eid="HEB 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11"/>Hinu, tikangamalayi kupokela pumulila lenilo, muni akotoka kuvya mundu pagati yitu mweibela kuyidakila ngati chavahengili vene.<verse eid="HEB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12"/>Lilovi la Chapanga ndi mumi na lina makakala. Na litema kuliku upanga wowoha wewitema pandi zoha. Kangi liholota mbaka pevikonganika mtima na mpungu, na mewawa litema mbaka muvinjukulundu na mahuta ga majege pevikonganika, kangi liyuyuka kuhamula mnogo na maholo ga mitima ya vandu. <verse eid="HEB 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13"/>Kawaka chiwumbi chochoha chechifiyiki palongolo ya Chapanga, kila chindu chigubukuliwi njwe palongolo ya mihu gaki, mwene ndi mweihamula kila chindu chetihenga.<verse eid="HEB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi Mteta Mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14"/>Hinu, tiyikamula bwina sadika yetiwungama. Muni tivii na Mteta Mkulu mweiyingili mbaka kunani kwa Chapanga, Yesu Mwana wa Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15"/>Ndava muni tivii na Mteta Mkulu wa Chapanga mweakutihengela lipyana, ndava ungolongondi witu, mwene alingiwi ngati tete mukila namuna nambu ambudili lepi Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16"/>Hinu, na tichihegelela chigoda cha ulongosi cha Chapanga pepavi na ubwina, changali wogohi mweavi na ubwina, tipokela lipyana na mota wa kututangatila lukumbi lwa mang'ahiso.<verse eid="HEB 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1"/>Kila Mteta Mkulu wa Chapanga ihaguliwa pagati ya vandu ipewa lihengu la kukita mambu ga Chapanga pahali pa vandu, kuwusa luteta lwa kuhinjwa hinyama na luteta lungi. <verse eid="HEB 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2"/>Muni mwene ndi mngolongondi namuna ndalindali, ihotola kuvahengela lipyana vala vangammanya na vevihotola na kukongiwa. <verse eid="HEB 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3"/>Ndava yeniyo iganikiwa kuwusa luteta lwa kuhinja hinyama, lepi ndava ya vandu ndu, nambu mewa ndava ya mwene kumbudila Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4"/>Kawaka mundu mweakujipela mwene utopesa wa kuvya Mteta Mkulu. Nambu Chapanga akumhagula kuvya Mteta Mkulu ngati Aloni cheahaguliwi.<verse eid="HEB 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5"/>Mewawa Kilisitu, nakujipela mwene utopesa wa kuvya Mteta Mkulu, pahali paki Chapanga amhagwili na kujova,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:5">“Veve ndi Mwana vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:5">nene lelu nivii Dadi waku.”<verse eid="HEB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6"/>Mewawa ajovili, pandu pangi mu Mayandiku Gamsopi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:6">“Veve ndi Mteta wa magono goha gangali mwishu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:6">ngati cheuvili uteta wa Melikisedeki.”<verse eid="HEB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7"/>Yesu petamili pamulima, amyupili Chapanga kwa luyupu na maganu na kuvemba kwa maholi, mweihotola kumsangula kuhuma mu lifwa. Chapanga amuyuwanili, ndava avi kuyidakila kwaki na ungolongondi. <verse eid="HEB 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8"/>Nambu, pamonga avi Mwana wa Chapanga, amanyili kumyidakila Chapanga kwa mang'ahiso gegamkolili. <verse eid="HEB 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9"/>Peamali kuvya mkamilifu mukila njila, avi utumbula wa usangula wa magono goha gangali mwishu kwa vandu voha vevakumyidakila, <verse eid="HEB 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10"/>kangi Chapanga amuhagwili kuvya Mteta Mkulu kwa luhumu lwa Melikisedeki.<verse eid="HEB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jiyangalila kuyileka sadika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11"/>Tivii na gamahele ga kujova ndava ya lijambu ili, nambu yinonopa kuvadandaulila, ndava nyenye mwiyuyuka lepi kumanya. <verse eid="HEB 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12"/>Chakaka lukumbi ulu, mwiganikiwa kuvya vawula, muni lukumbi lutali lupitili, nambu mwakona mwigana mundu yungi avawula mawuliwu ga kutumbula ga ujumbi wa Chapanga. Pahali pa kulya chakulya chiyumu, nyenye mwinyong'a mavele ngati vana vang'enya! <verse eid="HEB 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13"/>Ndava mundu yeyoha mweigana kunyong'a mavele akona mwana mng'enya, ihotola lepi kumanya mawuliwu ga kumganisa Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14"/>Nambu chakulya chiyumu ndi ndava ya vandu vevakangili, ndava vajiwulili vene kuyendelela kuhenga ago, vahotola kulola ulekenganu pagati ya gabwina na gahakau.<verse eid="HEB 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1"/>Hinu, tigaleka pamuhana mawuliwu ga kutumbula kumvala Kilisitu, tihegelela kulongolo mu mawuliwu gegakangili, na lepi kuyendelela kuvika mkingisa ndava kulekana na matendu gangali mana, na kuuvala kumsadika Chapanga, <verse eid="HEB 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2"/>mawuliwu kuuvala ubatizu na mawuliwu ga kuvikiwa mawoko na mawuliwu ga kuyuka na kuhamuliwa magono goha gangali mwishu. <verse eid="HEB 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3"/>Na ago yati tihenga Chapanga akaganayi.<verse eid="HEB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4"/>Ndava muni yinonopa kuvakita vandu vamuwuyila Chapanga kavili, vandu vala vevavi mu lumuli vamali kupokela chipanji cha kunani kwa Chapanga, vamali kumpokela Mpungu Msopi ngati vandu vangi, <verse eid="HEB 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5"/>na kumyanga ubwina wa lilovi la Chapanga, na makakala ga mulima weubwela, <verse eid="HEB 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6"/>kangi vakuyileka sadika yavi, nakuhotoleka kuvakita venavo vamuwuyila Chapanga kangi. Venavo vakumvamba pamsalaba kavili Mwana wa Chapanga na kumpela soni pavandu.<verse eid="HEB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7"/>Ndima yipokela fula yeyitonya pamahele, na yiwusa mabenu, gegakumpela chiyonjokesu mlimaji, mgunda wenuwo umotisiwi na Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8"/>Nambu mgunda weumelesa minga na matutu, wangali lihengu, papipi Chapanga kupewa likoto na Chapanga kangi kutinyiswa pa motu.<verse eid="HEB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9"/>Vankozi vitu, pamonga tijova chenichi, timanyi chakaka kuvya muvi na mambu gabwina neju, gegihuma mu usangula winu. <verse eid="HEB 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10"/>Ndava muni Chapanga ibuda lepi kuhamula lihengu linu na uganu wemlangisi ndava yaki namuna chamuvatangatili na chemwiyendelela kuvatangatila vandu vaki. <verse eid="HEB 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11"/>Mnogo witu ndi kuvya kila mmonga winu alangisa ukangamala wulawula mbaka pa mwishu, muni mambu gala gemuhuvalila gahotola kutimila. <verse eid="HEB 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12"/>Tiganili lepi mvya vakata, nambu muvayigila vala vevisadika na kusindimala muni mpokela gala geajovili Chapanga.<verse eid="HEB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilagizu la Chapanga ndi la Chakaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13"/>Chapanga pealagini na Ibulahimu, muni kwavi lepi mkulu kuliku Chapanga alapili kwa kuhengela liina laki mwene, <verse eid="HEB 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14"/>Chapanga amlagili Ibulahimu, “Chakaka yati nikukumotisa na kukupela vana ngoo.” <verse eid="HEB 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15"/>Ibulahimu alindili kwa usindimala kangi apokili chila chealagini Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16"/>Vandu pevilapa, vilapa kwa liina la mweavi mkulu kuliku vene na chilapu chilangisa kuvya chechijoviwi ndi chakaka, chilapu chitepulanisa ndindani yoha. <verse eid="HEB 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17"/>Ndava Chapanga aganili kuvalangisa hotohoto vala vevipokela lilagizu laki kwa kulapa, mu kukita chenicho alangisi vala veavikini nawu lilagizu kuvya katu ing'anamusa lepi cheigana. <verse eid="HEB 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18"/>Hinu, kuvi na vindu vivili, lilagizu na chilapu, vihotola lepi kung'anamuka mu vindu vyenivyo vivili Chapanga ihotola lepi kujova udese. Hinu tete vetijumbalili kwaki, tikangamaliswa mtima kukamulila neju huvalila lelivikiwi palongolo yitu. <verse eid="HEB 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19"/>Huvalila yeniyi ngati nanga muwumi witu. Huvalila yeniyi yiyimili na yivi makakala, liholota pagati ya lipazia, mbaka pandu Pamsopi neju, Munyumba ya Chapanga yeyivili kunani kwa Chapanga, <verse eid="HEB 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20"/>Yesu mwene alongolili kuyingila mwenumo ndava yitu, na avi Mteta Mkulu magono goha gangali mwishu, kwa kulanda uteta wa Melikisedeki.<verse eid="HEB 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7"/>
  <para style="s">Mteta Melikisedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1"/>Melikisedeki mwenuyo avi nkosi wa Salemu, na Mteta mkulu wa Chapanga mweavi kunani neju. Ibulahimu peawuyayi kuhuma ku ngondo kweavakomili vankosi, Melikisedeki akonganiki nayu, namwene Melikisedeki ammotisi, <verse eid="HEB 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2"/>na Ibulahimu ampelili lilundu la kumi pa vindu vyoha vyeanyagili kungondo. Mana ya liina Meilikisedeki, “Nkosi mbwina palongolo Chapanga,” Muni avi Nkosi wa Salemu liina laki mewa mana yaki “Nkosi wa uteke.” <verse eid="HEB 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3"/>Avi lepi na dadi amala mau mewa avi lepi na lukolo, kawaka mundu mweimanya avelekiwi ndali amala afwili ndali. Iwanangana na Mwana wa Chapanga, na iyendelela kuvya Mteta Mkulu magono goha gangali mwishu.<verse eid="HEB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4"/>Hinu, mhololela mundu uyu cheavili mkulu. Hati Gogo witu Ibulahimu ampelili lilundu la kumi pa vindu vyoha vyeanyagili ku ngondo. <verse eid="HEB 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5"/>Kulandana na Mihilu ya Chapanga, yikuvahamula vachiveleku va Lawi ndi vamteta vakulu va Chapanga, viganikiwa kupokela lilundu limonga pagati ya kumi kuhuma kwa valongo vavi vandu va Isilaeli, pamonga vene valongo vavi ndi vachiveleku va Ibulahimu. <verse eid="HEB 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6"/>Nambu Melikisedeki mwenuyu avi lepi wa Chiveleku cha Lawi, nambu apokili lilundu la kumi kuhuma kwa Ibulahimu, kavili ammotisi mwene mweapewili lilagizu na Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7"/>Na timanyili bwina kuvya mkulu ndi mweakummotisa mdebe. <verse eid="HEB 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8"/>Kangi mu lijambu lenili vakulu va kuteta va Chapanga vevipokela lilundu la kumi, ndi vandu vevifwa, nambu Melikisedeki mweapokili lilundu la kumi yijoveka kuvya ifwa lepi. <verse eid="HEB 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9"/>Kangi, tihotola kujova kuvya, Ibulahimu peawusili lilundu la kumi, mewawa Lawi pamonga vachiveleku vaki ndi vevipokela lilundu la kumi mewa Lawi awusili lilundu la kumi ndava muni avi chiveleku cha Ibulahimu. <verse eid="HEB 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10"/>Ndava Melikisedeki peakonganiki na Ibulahimu, Lawi avi akona kuvelekewa, avi akona muhiga ya dadi waki.<verse eid="HEB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11"/>Vandu va Isilaeli vapewili malagizu mumkingisa wa uteta wa Valawi. Ngati lihengu la uteta lavi kamilifu, ngayiganikiwi lepi kuhumila mteta yungi wa Chapanga mweiwanangana na Melikisedeki, na lepi Aloni. <verse eid="HEB 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12"/>Ndava muni uteta wa Chapanga wakang'anamuka, malagizu na gene mewawa ging'anamuka. <verse eid="HEB 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13"/>Na Bambu witu ndi mambu goha getijova ndava yaki, avi wa likabila lingi na kawaka hati mmonga wa likabila laki mweahengili pa lusanja lwa luteta ngati mteta Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14"/>Timanyili hotohoto kuvya Bambu witu ihuma mu likabila la Yuda, Musa aliluwili lepi peajovili kuuvala lukolo lwenulo mu mambu ga vamteta va Chapanga.<verse eid="HEB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mteta yungi mwewanangana na Melikisedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15"/>Kangi lijambu lenili lilangisa hotohoto neju, malovi aga, ahumalili mteta yungi mweavi ngati Melikisedeki. <verse eid="HEB 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16"/>Mwene akitiwi lepi mteta wa Chapanga kwa malagizu na malagizu ga chimundu, nambu kwa makakala ga wumi wangali mwishu. <verse eid="HEB 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17"/>Muni Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova, “Veve ndi Mteta wa Chapanga wa magono goha gangali mwishu ngati cheuvili uteta wa Melikisedeki.” <verse eid="HEB 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18"/>Hinu, mhilu wula wa kadeni yavikiwi pamuhana ndava yangali makakala na yangafaya chindu. <verse eid="HEB 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19"/>Muni Malagizu ga Bambu geampeli Musa gangahotola kukamilisa lijambu loloha. Nambu hinu, pandu paki pavikiwi huvalila yabwina neju yeyihotosa kumhegelela Chapanga papipi.<verse eid="HEB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20"/>Neju ya genago, apa pavi na chilapu cha Chapanga. Lukumbi vala vangi pavakitiwi vamteta va Chapanga pangali chilapu chochoha. <verse eid="HEB 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21"/>Nambu Yesu ahengiwi kuvya Mteta kwa chilapu lukumbi Chapanga peamjovili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">“Bambu alapili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">kangi ing'anamuka lepi maholo gaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">‘Veve ndi mteta wa Chapanga magono goha gangali mwishu.’ ”<verse eid="HEB 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22"/>Hinu, ndava ya kulapa kwenuko, Yesu ndi ulangisu wa chakaka wa kutilangisa tivii na huvalila ya lilaganu labwina neju.<verse eid="HEB 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23"/>Kangi kwavi na vamteta vangi vamahele va lilaganu la kadeni, vangahotola kuyendelela na lihengu lavi ndava vafwili. <verse eid="HEB 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24"/>Nambu Yesu itama magono goha gangali mwishu, na uteta waki wihotoleka lepi kupewa mundu yungi. <verse eid="HEB 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25"/>Ndava yeniyo, mwene ihotola kuvasangula voha vevakumhambila Chapanga kwa njila yaki, ndava itama magono goha gangali mwishu, muni avayupila kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="HEB 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26"/>Muni taganikiwi kuvya na Mteta Mkulu ngati mwenuyu mweavi Msopi na angabuda na mwangambudila Chapanga. Mweabaguliwi kutali na vevakumbudila Chapanga, na mweatoliwi kunani neju kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27"/>Mwene avi lepi ngati vamteta vakulu vangi, iganikiwa lepi kuwusa luteta lwa kuhinjwa hinyama kila ligono, ndava ya kubuda kwaki mwene kavili ndava ya kubuda kwa vandu vangi. Mwene ajiwusili kuvya luteta mala yimonga ndu mu lukumbi lwoha. <verse eid="HEB 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28"/>Malagizu ga Musa gakuvahagula vandu vangolongondi kuvya vamteta vakulu va Chapanga, nambu malagizu ga Chapanga gahengili kwa chilapu chechibwela palongolo ya malagizu, gamhagwili Mwana mweakitiwi mkamilifu magono goha gangali mwishu.<verse eid="HEB 7:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi Mteta witu Mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1"/>Hinu, lijambu likulu pa genaga leajovili ndi lenili, tete tivii na Mteta Mkulu wa Chapanga ngati uyu, mweitama na pandu pa utopesa pa chiwoko cha kulyelela wa chigoda ya cha Chapanga cha kulongosa ukulu kunani kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2"/>Mwene ihenga lihengu ngati Mteta Mkulu pandu Pamsopi neju, palindanda la chakaka la Chapanga, lelijengiwi na Bambu lepi na mundu.<verse eid="HEB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3"/>Kila Mteta Mkulu ahaguliwi kumuwusila Chapanga luteta lwa hinyama ya kuhinjwa na luteta lungi, ndi mewa Mteta mkulu witu yiganikiwa avyai na chindu cha kumuwusila Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4"/>Ngati kuvya avi apa pamulima, ngaavili lepi Mteta, muni vamali kuvya vamteta veviwusa luteta ngati cheavalagazili mu Malagizu ga Musa. <verse eid="HEB 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5"/>Lihengu lavi la uteta ndi luhumu ndu na chiwili cha gala gegavi kunani kwa Chapanga. Muni Musa peavi papipi kujenga lindanda lila, Chapanga amjovili, “Lola ujengayi ngati luhumu lula lwenakulangisi kuchitumbi cha Sinai.” <verse eid="HEB 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6"/>Nambu hinu Yesu apewili lihengu la uteta lelivili likulu kuliku lavi, ndava muni lilaganu leavikili pagati ya Chapanga na vandu lavili labwina neju, ndava muni liyima panani ya lilagizu la mambu gegavi gabwina neju.<verse eid="HEB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7"/>Muni ngati lilaganu lila la kutumbula langabuda, langaganikiwi lilaganu la pili. <verse eid="HEB 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8"/>Nambu Chapanga alolili kubuda kwa vandu ndi akajova,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">“Magono gibwela, Bambu ijova,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">yati nikita lilaganu la mupya, na vandu va Isilaeli na vandu va Yuda.<verse eid="HEB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9"/>Lilaganu lenili yati liwanangana lepi ngati lila lenakitili na vagogo vavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">mu ligono panavatolili kwa chiwoko changu kuhuma pamulima wa Misili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">Muni vayidakili lepi lilaganu langu lenakiti nawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">ndava yeniyo nene navabelili, Bambu ijova.<verse eid="HEB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10"/>Hinu lenili ndi lilaganu yati lenikita na vandu va Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">magono gegibwela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">Yati nivika Malagizu gangu muluhala lwavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">na kuzivika mu mitima yavi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">Nene yati nivya Chapanga wavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">navene yati vivya vandu vangu.<verse eid="HEB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11"/>Kawaka mundu mweakumuwula muyaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">amala kumjovela mlongo waki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">‘Mmanya Bambu.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">Muni voha vadebe na vavaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">yati vakunimanya.<verse eid="HEB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12"/>Yati nikuvalekekesa kumbudila Chapanga wavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:12">yati nizihololela lepi kavili mabudili gavi.”<verse eid="HEB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13"/>Chapanga peakulikemela lilaganu lenili lamupya, lila la kadeni lilalili, na chindu chochoha chechivya chigogolo na chechilalili chivii papipi na kuyaga.<verse eid="HEB 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9"/>
  <para style="s">Kumuyupa Chapanga pamulima na kunani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1"/>Lilaganu la kutumbula lavi na mhilu waki wa kuyupila na mewa pandu Pamsopi pa kuyupila pepajengiwi na vandu pamulima apa. <verse eid="HEB 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2"/>Pajengiwi lindanda la Chapanga. Chumba chaki cha kutumbula chakemeliwi Pandu Pamsopi. Mwenumo mwavili chibokoselu cha hahi, meza na mabumunda gegavikiwi palongolo ya Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3"/>Mumbele ya lipazia la pili, pavili na panzia leligavanisi vyumba vivili na chumba lelakemeliwi Pandu Pamsopi Neju. <verse eid="HEB 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4"/>Mwenumo mwavili na lusanja lwa kumuwusila luteta lwa kuhukisa ubani pandu pa zahabu, na lisanduku la lilaganu lelitindisiwi zahabu kwoha, na mugati yaki mwavi na chiviga cha zahabu chechavili na chakulya chechikemiwa mana, na ndonga ya Aloni yeyihomwili mahamba, na vila vibawu vya maganga vyeviyandikwi malagizu. <verse eid="HEB 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5"/>Panani ya lisanduku lenilo kwavili na vimong'omong'o vivili vyevii na magwaba ngati ulangisu wa ukulu wa Chapanga, ndi magwaba gavi gagubiki chigubiku cha lisanduku la lilaganu pepilekekeswa kumbudila Chapanga. Nambu hinu lukumbi lwaki lepi kudandaula kila chindu hotohoto ndava ya mambu genago.<verse eid="HEB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6"/>Hinu kila chindu pechatendelekiwi pandu paki, vamteta vayingila pamahele mu chumba cha kutumbula na kuwusa luteta kila ligono. <verse eid="HEB 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7"/>Nambu Mteta Mkulu mwene ndu ndi mweiyingila Pandu pa Msopi neju ngasi yeawusili luteta ndava ya kubuda kwaki na ndava ya mabudilu ga vandu gevahengili changamanya. <verse eid="HEB 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8"/>Mpungu Msopi ndi mweilangisa kuvya njila ya kuyingila pa Msopi neju yavili yakona kudinduliwa, lukumbi lwoha lindanda la kutumbula pelavi lakona liyimili. <verse eid="HEB 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9"/>Wenuwu ndi ulangisu kwa lukumbi lwa hinu, kuvya luteta lwa kuhinjwa hinyama na luteta lungi zeziwusiwa kwa Chapanga zihotola lepi kuukita mtima wa mundu mweiyupa Chapanga kuvya angabuda. <verse eid="HEB 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10"/>Mambu ago goha ga kadeni gakuvivala vyakulya na vinywelelu mvelu wa kusamba na kunyambisa higa, na makakala gaki gimalika Chapanga peikita aga goha gavyai gamupya.<verse eid="HEB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11"/>Nambu Kilisitu amali kuhika, ndi Mteta Mkulu wa mambu gabwina, gegabwelili hinu. Mwene ayingili mu lindanda labwina neju na likamilifu, langajengewa na mawoko ga vandu, ndi lepi pandu pamulima weuwumbiki. <verse eid="HEB 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12"/>Mwene ayingili pandu Pamsopi Neju mala yimonga ndu, mwene agegili, lepi ngasi ya mene amala ya ng'ombi ndava ya kuwusa luteta, nambu kwa ngasi yaki mwene, akatipela usangula wa magono goha gangali mwishu. <verse eid="HEB 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13"/>Vandu vevavi vahakau palongolo ya Chapanga, kulandana na mvelu wa kumuyupa Chapanga, vanyambasiki uhakau wavi wa higa munjila ya kunyunyuziwi ngasi ya lipongo na ng'ombi pamonga na malyenge ga mpapakasi. <verse eid="HEB 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14"/>Yikavya naha, wu, ngasi ya Kilisitu yivya lepi na uhotola neju wa kutinyambisa? Kwa makakala ga Mpungu wa magono goha gangali mwishu. Kilisitu ajiwusili mwene kuvya luteta lwanga libala lwelunyambisa mitima yitu, ndava ya matendu gangafwayi, muni tihotola kumhengela Chapanga mweavi mumi.<verse eid="HEB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15"/>Ndava yeniyo Kilisitu ndi mtepulanisi mwealetili lilaganu la mupya muni vala vevakemeliwi na Chapanga vihotola kupokela lilaganu la magono goha gangali mwishu levahaidiwi. Lenili lihotoleka ndava mu njila ya kufwa kwaki avagombwili vandu kuhuma muuhakau wavi wevahengili mu lukumbi lwa lilaganu la kadeni.<verse eid="HEB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16"/>Kwa mambu ga balua yeyiyandikwi ndava kuhala vindu yiganikiwa yiwonekanayi kuvya chakaka mweayandiki balua ya wosia wenuwo afwili, <verse eid="HEB 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17"/>Muni balua yeyiyandikwi ndava ya kuhala vindu yihotola lepi kuhumila mbaka lifwa lihumila. <verse eid="HEB 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18"/>Ndava yeniyo hati lilaganu lila la kutumbula lavikiwi lepi changali ngasi kuyitika. <verse eid="HEB 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19"/>Musa atumbwili hoti kuvakokosela vandu voha mihilu yoha ngati chegavili mu malagizu ga Musa, kangi akatola ngasi za mpapakasi na mapongo akahangisana pamonga na manji, na kwa manyayi ga mkongo wewikemelewa isopo na litonji lidung'u akakinyunyusila chila chitabu cha malagizu na vandu. <verse eid="HEB 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20"/>Musa ajovili, “Ngasi yeniyi ndi yikangamalisa lilaganu leajovili Chapanga muliyidakila.” <verse eid="HEB 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21"/>Mewawa Musa anyunyusili ngasi panani ya lindanda la Chapanga na vindu vyoha vya kutambikila. <verse eid="HEB 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22"/>Chakaka, kulandana na Malagizu ga Musa papipi kila chindu chihotola kunyambiswa kwa ngasi, na mabudilu gene giwusiwa pala ndu ngasi yakayitika.<verse eid="HEB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lifwa la Kilisitu liwusa kumbudila Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23"/>Vindu vyenivi ndi luhumu ndu lwa mambu chakaka ga kunani kwa Chapanga, viganikiwa kunyambiswa kwa njila yeniyo. Nambu vindu vya kunani kwa Chapanga vigana luteta lwa labwina neju. <verse eid="HEB 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24"/>Ndava Kilisitu ayingili lepi Pandu Pamsopi pepajengiwi kwa mawoko ga vandu, mwene ayingili kunani kwa Chapanga kwene, hinu iyima palongolo ya Chapanga ndava yitu. <verse eid="HEB 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25"/>Mteta Mkulu cheiyingila Pandu Pamsopi Neju, mala yimonga kila mwaka kwa ngasi yangavya yaki mwene. Nambu Kilisitu nakuyingila kunani kwa Chapanga muni ahotola kujiwusa mwene kila mwaka. <verse eid="HEB 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26"/>Muni kuvya gavyai genago, Kilisitu ngaang'aiswi pamahele kutumbula kuwumbwa kwa mulima. Nambu hinu, lusenje peluhegelela mwishu waki, mwene ahumalili mala yimonga ndu, alekekesa kumbudila Chapanga kwa luteta lwaki mwene. <verse eid="HEB 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27"/>Kila mundu ifwa mala yimonga ndu, kangi ihamuliwa na Chapanga, <verse eid="HEB 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28"/>mewawa Kilisitu namwene ajiwusili tambiko mala yimonga ndu, muni avalekekesa mabudili ga vandu vamahele. Peihumila mala ya pili ibwela lepi ndava ya kuwusa kumbudila Chapanga, nambu ndava ya kuvasangula vandu vala vevakumlindila.<verse eid="HEB 9:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1"/>Ndava Malagizu ga Musa ndi chimuwili ndu cha mambu gabwina gegibwela, na lepi mambu gene chakaka, yilangisa padebe ndu mambu gala chakaka chegavili, luteta lulalula lwa Malagizu ga Musa zeziwusiwa mwaka hati mwaka. Yihotoleka lepi kutu kuvakita vala vevakumuyupa Chapanga vavyai vakamilifu. <verse eid="HEB 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2"/>Ngati vandu vala vevakumuyupa Chapanga ngavanyambiswi njwe kuhuma mukumbudila Chapanga, ngavalekili kujilola kavili ngati vabudili, na luteta lula lweviwusa ngalumaliki. <verse eid="HEB 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3"/>Nambu luteta lwenulo luhengeka kila mwaka, ndava ya kuvakumbusa vandu kumbudila Chapanga kwavi. <verse eid="HEB 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4"/>Muni ngasi ya ng'ombi yigosi na mene vihotola lepi kuwusa kumbudila Chapanga.<verse eid="HEB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5"/>Ndava yeniyo Kilisitu peavili mukubwela pamulima, amjovili Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:5">“Veve waganili lepi luteta amala luteta lwa kuhinja hinyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:5">nambu wanitendelekili higa.<verse eid="HEB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6"/>Luteta lwa kutinyiswa hinyama palusanja lwa luteta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:6">amala za kulekekesa kubuda zakuganisi lepi.<verse eid="HEB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7"/>Kangi najovili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:7">‘Nivii apa ee Chapanga, kukita gewigana</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:7">ngati cheyiyandikwi muchitabu cha Malagizu ga Musa kunivala nene.’ ”<verse eid="HEB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8"/>Kilisitu ajovili hoti, “Waganili lepi amala waganisiwi lepi na luteta lwa kuhinjwa hinyama, luteta lwa kutinyiswa na luteta la kulekekesa mabudilu.” Ajovili genago hati ngati luteta lungi lwawusiwi kulandana na malagizu ga Musa. <verse eid="HEB 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9"/>Kangi akajova, “Nene nivii apa veve Chapanga, kukita gala gewigana.” Ndi Chapanga avikili pamuhana luteta lwa kadeni, pandu paki akamvika Kilisitu avya luteta. <verse eid="HEB 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10"/>Ndava Yesu Kilisitu ahengili geigana Chapanga, tete tinyambiswi mabudilu gitu kwa tambiko la higa yaki mwene yeyiwusiwi luteta mala yimonga ndu kwa vandu voha.<verse eid="HEB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11"/>Kila Mteta ihenga lihengu kila ligono na kuwusa teta zilazila pamahele, tambiko zenizo zihotola lepi katu kuwusa kubuda. <verse eid="HEB 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12"/>Nambu Kilisitu mwene awusili luteta lumonga ndava ya kuwusa mabudilu, luteta lwa makakala la magono goha gangali mwishu, kangi itama pahala pa utopesa chiwoko cha kulyelela kunani. <verse eid="HEB 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13"/>Tangia lukumbi lwenulo akumlindila Chapanga avavika vamakoko vaki pahi ngati chigoda cha kuvikila magendelu gaki. <verse eid="HEB 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14"/>Ndava yeniyo kwa luteta lwa kutinyisa yimonga, avakitili vala vevanyambiswi kuvya vakamilifu vala voha vevanyambiswi.<verse eid="HEB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15"/>Na Mpungu Msopi mweakuvajovela vandu lijambu lenili, hoti ijova<verse eid="HEB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16"/>“Lenili ndi lilaganu lenihenga nawu, magono gegibwela, ijova Bambu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">Yati nivika Malagizu gangu mumitima yavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">na kuziyandika mumitima yavi.”<verse eid="HEB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17"/>Kangi akayonjokesa kujova, “Yati nikumbuka lepi kangi mabudilu gavi na uhakau wevauhengili.” <verse eid="HEB 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18"/>Hinu, gevambudili Chapanga gakamala kulekekeswa, kawaka kuwusa luteta ndava ya kulekekesa kumabudila Chapanga.<verse eid="HEB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Timuhegelela Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19"/>Hinu, valongo, tivii na ukekesi wa kuyingila Pandu Pamsopi Neju kwa njila ya ngasi ya Yesu. <verse eid="HEB 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20"/>Mwene atidindulili njila ya mupya, njila yeyikutilongosa muwumi, kupitila lipazia lila ndi higa yaki mwene. <verse eid="HEB 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21"/>Hinu, tivii na Mteta Mkulu mweavi na uhotola mu Nyumba ya Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22"/>Hinu, timuhegelela Chapanga kwa mitima ya uchakaka na sadika yeyitimili, kwa mitima yeyinyambiswi, ndi mitima yangavahamula kavili kuvya mumbudili Chapanga na higa yeyinyambiswi na manji gabwina. <verse eid="HEB 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23"/>Tikamulila njwe huvalila yitu yetikuyisadika na yetijova, muni Chapanga mweavikili lilaganu laki ndi msadikika. <verse eid="HEB 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24"/>Titangatilana tavete, tikangamalisana mtima, kuvya na uganu na kuhenga gabwina. <verse eid="HEB 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25"/>Kangi tikotoka kuleka kukonganeka pamonga na kumuyupa Bambu, ngati chevikita vandu vangi. Nambu tiganikiwa kukangamalisana mtima, ngati neju chemwilola, ligono la Bambu kubwela lihegelela.<verse eid="HEB 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26"/>Muni, takayendelela kuhenga mabudilu kwa kugana kuni timanya uchakaka, kawaka luteta lweluhotola kuwusiwa kavili ndava ya kuwusa getimbudili Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27"/>Nambu lelisigalila ndi kulindila kwa wogohi, uhamula wa Chapanga kwa motu ukali weukuvatinyisa voha vevakumbela Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28"/>Mundu yeyoha mweangayidakila Malagizu ga Musa, akomiwi changali lipyana hati ngati kuvi na vandu vavili amala vadatu vevaliweni na kujova akitili lijambu lenilo. <verse eid="HEB 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29"/>Wu, mundu yula mweakumvevesa Mwana wa Chapanga na kuyiyivevesa ngasi ya lilaganu la Chapanga yeyivanyambisi? Wu, Mundu mweakumliga Mpungu wa ubwina wa Chapanga, holalela iganikiwa lepi kupewa mbunu ukali neju? <verse eid="HEB 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30"/>Muni tikuchimanya chila cheajovili Chapanga, “Nene yati nikuvabuna, nikumkiliwusila cheatinihengili,” Kangi ajovili, “Bambu yati akuvahamula vandu vaki.” <verse eid="HEB 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31"/>Ndi lijambu la kuyogofya neju kugwilila mu mawoko ga Chapanga mweavi mumi!<verse eid="HEB 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32"/>Mkumbuka pemwagubukuliwi uchakaka wa Chapanga magono gala ga utumbula. Pamonga mwapatili mang'ahiso gamahele, nyenye mwakangamili kuyima. <verse eid="HEB 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33"/>Lukumbi lungi mwaligiwi na kukola soni pavandu, magono gangi mwayidakili kuvya pamonga na vala vevang'aiswi namuna yiyoyo. <verse eid="HEB 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34"/>Mwavahengili lipyana vala vevavi muchifungu, pemywagiwa vindu vinu mwayidakili kwa luheku ndava muni mwamanyili muvi na vindu vyabwina neju vyevisindimala magono goha gangali mwishu. <verse eid="HEB 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35"/>Hinu, muvya na ukekesi yati yikuvapela njombi yivaha. <verse eid="HEB 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36"/>Mganikiwa kusindimala muni muhengayi geigana Chapanga na pahala pa apo mupokela chila cheavalagazili.<verse eid="HEB 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37"/>Muni ngati chegijova Mayandiku Gamsopi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">“Pakona padebe ndu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">na yula mweibwela yati ibwela, na ikavila lepi.<verse eid="HEB 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38"/>Nambu mundu mbwina palongolo yangu yati isadika na kutama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:38">nambu akalekayi kunisadika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:38">nene nakuganikiwa nayu.”<verse eid="HEB 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39"/>Hinu, tete lepi vandu vetikuyileka sadika na kuyaga, nambu tete ndi vandu vetisadika na kusanguliwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11"/>
  <para style="s">Kumsadika Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1"/>Sadika ndi kuvya na uchakaka wa mambu getihuvalila na kumanya njwe chakaka vindu vyangawonekana vivili. <verse eid="HEB 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2"/>Kwa kumsadika Chapanga vagogo vitu kadeni, vayidakiliwi na Chapanga.<verse eid="HEB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3"/>Kwa sadika tete timanya kuvya mulima wawumbiwi kwa lilovi la Chapanga, hati vindu vyeviwonekana vyawumbiwi kuhuma vindu vyangalolekana.<verse eid="HEB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4"/>Kwa kumsadika Chapanga Abeli amuwusili Chapanga luteta lwa kuhinjwa yeyivili yabwina neju kuliku yila ya Kaini. Ndava ya sadika ayidakiliwi na Chapanga kuvya mbwina palongolo yaki, Chapanga mwene aziyidakili luteta zaki. Kwa sadika yaki pamonga afwili, akona akutiwula timhuvalila Chapanga.<verse eid="HEB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5"/>Kwa kumsadika Chapanga, Henoki atoliwi kuhamba kunani kwa Chapanga, ndi afwili lepi. Awonikini lepi kavili muni Chapanga amtolili. Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova kuvya, kwakona kutoliwa kuhamba kunani kwa Chapanga ayidakiliwi kuvya mundu mweamganisi Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6"/>Kawaka mundu mweihotola kumganisa Chapanga changali kumsadika, ndava muni kila mundu mweakumhambila Chapanga ndi yikumgana asadika kuvya Chapanga avili, namwene akuvayunga vevakumgana kwa kukangamala.<verse eid="HEB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7"/>Kwa kumsadika Chapanga Nuhu, ajoviwi na Chapanga mambu gala gegibwela kulongolo, gala gegawonekini lepi. Ndava ya kumyidakili Chapanga, ajengili Safina, mwenumo mwene pamonga na vandu va mu lukolo lwaki vasanguliwi. Kwa kusadika kwaki alangisi vandu voha vandu voha va pamulima vahukumiwi ndava ya uhakau, na Chapanga amkitili kuvya mbwina palongolo yaki ndava ya kumsadika.<verse eid="HEB 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8"/>Kwa kumsadika Chapanga Ibulahimu akemeliwi ahambayi pamulima weajovili Chapanga yati akumpela. Aulekili mulima waki Changali kumanya ihamba koki. <verse eid="HEB 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9"/>Kwa kumsadika Chapanga, Ibulahimu avili myehe pamulima wealagaziwi na Chapanga. Atamili kwenuko mulindanda ngati cheatamili Izaki na Yakobo, vevapokili lilagizu lilalila kuhuma Kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10"/>Muni Ibulahimu avi mukulindila muji weujengiwi kwa mkingisa wa kusindimala, muji wewaholaliwi na kujengwa na Chapanga mwene.<verse eid="HEB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11"/>Kwa kumsadika Chapanga, Ibulahimu avi Dadi hati ngati avi mgogolo neju na Sala avi ngaveleka. Ibulahimu amsadiki Chapanga yati itimilisa malagizu gaki. <verse eid="HEB 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12"/>Kuhumila kwa mundu mwenuyo mmonga, Ibulahimu, mweavi ngati afwili, vavelakiwi vandu vamahele vangavalangika ngati ndondo za kunani kwa Chapanga na msavati wa kumbwani.<verse eid="HEB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13"/>Vandu ava voha vafwili kuni vakona vakumsadika Chapanga. Vapokili lepi gala gealagazili Chapanga, nambu vagawene cha kutali na kuhekelela, vasadiki kuvya vene ndi vayehe vavili lepi na pakutama ngati pavi apa pamulima. <verse eid="HEB 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14"/>Vandu vevijova mambu ngati ago vilangisa kuvya vaulonda mulima uvya wavi vene. <verse eid="HEB 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15"/>Ngaviholalela mulima wevaumili kadeni ngavahotwili kuwuya kwenuko. <verse eid="HEB 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16"/>Nambu pahala paki vinogela mulima wabwina neju, ndi mulima wa kunani kwa Chapanga. Ndava yeniyo Chapanga ikola lepi soni kukemelewa Chapanga wavi, muni avatendelekili muji.<verse eid="HEB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17"/>Kwa kumsadika Chapanga, Ibulahimu ayidakili kumuwusa Izaki mweavi mwana waki ngati luteta pala pealingiwi na Chapanga. Ibulahimu mweapokili lilagizu la Chapanga, nambu hati ago, ayidakili kumuwusa luteta mwana waki ngayuyo. <verse eid="HEB 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18"/>Pamonga Chapanga amjovili Ibulahimu, “Vachiveleku vaku yati vihumila kwa Izaki.” <verse eid="HEB 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19"/>Ibulahimu asadiki Chapanga ihotola kuyukisa vandu vevafwili, na tihotola kujova chakaka Ibulahimu ampokili kavili Izaki kuhuma vandu vevafwili.<verse eid="HEB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20"/>Kwa kumsadika Chapanga Izaki avamotisi Yakobo na Esau, kwa gala gegibwela mwanakandahi.<verse eid="HEB 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21"/>Kwa kumsadika Chapanga Yakobo peavi papipi kufwa, avamotisi vana voha va Yosefu, akamgundamila Chapanga kuni ayegemili ndonga yaki.<verse eid="HEB 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22"/>Kwa kumsadika Chapanga Yosefu peavi papipi kufwa, ajovili ndava ya kuhuma kwa vandu va Isilaeli mulima wa ku Misili, na mewa avalagazili vatola majege gaki peviwuka.<verse eid="HEB 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23"/>Kwa kumsadika Chapanga dadi na nyina wa Musa vamhiyili Musa mulukumbi lwa miheyi yidatu peamali kuvelekewa. Vamuwene kuvya mwana mbwina, wala vayogwipi lepi malagizu ga nkosi.<verse eid="HEB 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24"/>Kwa kumsadika Chapanga Musa peavi mundu mvaha, abelili kukemelewa mwana wa msikana wa Falao ndi nkosi wa Misili. <verse eid="HEB 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25"/>Awene mbanga kung'ahika pamonga na vandu va Chapanga kuliku kuhekelela luheku lwa kumbudila Chapanga, mulukumbi luhupi. <verse eid="HEB 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26"/>Amanyili kuvya kung'ahika ndava ya Kilisitu ndi lijambu labwina kuliku umahele wa vindu vyoha vya mulima wa Misili, muni alolelayi kupokela luhuna lwaki lwa wumi wa magono goha gangali mwishu.<verse eid="HEB 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27"/>Kwa kumsadika Chapanga Musa ahumili ku Misili changali kuyogopa ligoga la nkosi. Na asindimili ndava avi ngati mundu mweamuwene Chapanga angalolekana kwa mihu. <verse eid="HEB 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28"/>Kwa kumsadika Chapanga, Musa akitili mselebuko wa Pasaka na kulagiza ngasi yinyunyuziwa panani ya milyangu, muni mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga wa mweatumwili kuleta lifwa akotoka kuvakoma vana vagosi vatumbulanu va Isilaeli.<verse eid="HEB 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29"/>Kwa kumsadika Chapanga vandu va Isilaeli vakupwiki nyanja ya Shamu ngati pa ndumba, nambu Vamisili pavaganili kukupuka vafwili mumanji.<verse eid="HEB 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30"/>Kwa kumsadika Chapanga luwumba lwa muji wa Yeliko lwagwili, vandu va Isilaeli pevamali kuzitindila luwumba zenizo mu magono saba. <verse eid="HEB 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31"/>Kwa kumsadika Chapanga Lahabu mweavi yula mdala mkemi akomiwi lepi na vala vangasadika, ndava avapokili chabwina vamang'omesi va Isilaeli.<verse eid="HEB 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32"/>Hinu, nijova kyani neju? Nivii lepi na fwasi ya kujova mambu ga Gidioni na Balaki na Samsoni na Yefuta na Daudi na Samueli na vamlota va Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33"/>Kwa kumsadika Chapanga vandu venavo vavahotwili vankosi. Vavahamwili ngati cheyikumganisa Chapanga, na vapokili gala gevalagaziwi na Chapanga. Vakungili milomo ya mahimba, <verse eid="HEB 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34"/>vajimisi miali ya motu, vatilili kukomiwa kwa vipula, pevavi vangolongondi, vasopiwi makakala, vavi vakekesi ku ngondo, vavavingili manjolinjoli vayehe. <verse eid="HEB 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35"/>Kwa kumsadika Chapanga vadala vangi vakiliwusiwi valongo vevafwili kwa kuyukiswa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:35">Vangi vavi vang'aiki mpaka kufwa vabeli kudinduliwa muni vayukiswayi na kuyingila muwumi weuvi wabwina neju. <verse eid="HEB 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36"/>Vangi vaveviswi na kutoviwa michapilu, vangi vakungiwi minyololo na kutagilwa muchifungu. <verse eid="HEB 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37"/>Vafwili kwa kutoviwa na maganga, vangi vadumuliwi kwa msumeno hipandi hivili, vangi vakomiwi kwa vipula. Valyungilyungi kuni vawalili vikumba vya mambelele na mene. Vavi vandu vangangu, vang'aiswi na kukitiwa uhakau. <verse eid="HEB 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38"/>Mulima waganikiwa lepi kuvya na vandu ngati avo. Valyungilyungili kulugangatu na kuchitumbi, vatama mu mbugu na mumagodi ga pandima.<verse eid="HEB 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39"/>Vandu ava voha vawonikini kuvya vakekesi ndava ya kusadika kwavi. Pamonga na ago, vapokili lepi gala geajovili Chapanga, <verse eid="HEB 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40"/>ndava Chapanga aganili kutihengela lijambu labwina neju ndava yitu, muni aganili kuvya vene pamonga na tete ndu kuvya vakamilifu.<verse eid="HEB 11:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12"/>
  <para style="s">Chapanga ndi akutihakalila tivya vana vaki vabwina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1"/>Ndava tivii na msambi uwu uvaha wa vandu vevakumsadika Chapanga lelikutilola, hinu tiwusa chidivililu chechikutidivalila na kubuda kula kwekutikamula kanyata. Tijumba changali kufwa mtima mumkinu wa kujumba weuvi palongolo yitu. <verse eid="HEB 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2"/>Timuhutusila mihu Yesu mweayitumbwili sadika na yati akuyitimilisa. Ndava ya luheku lweluvikiwi palongolo yaki, akangamili lifwa pamsalaba hati ngati lavili lijambu lelileta soni, hinu mwene atamili pandu pa utopesa neju mchiwoko cha kulyelela wa chigoda cha Unkosi wa Chapanga.<verse eid="HEB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3"/>Ndava yeniyo mumholalela Yesu, cheahengiwi ngati likoko na vandu vevakumbudila Chapanga wa kuhakaliwa neju. Hinu, mkoto kutotokela na kudenyeka mtima. <verse eid="HEB 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4"/>Muni mukutovana ngondo yemwikita kuyihotola mukumbudila Chapanga, mwakona mtovini lepi mbaka kufwa. <verse eid="HEB 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5"/>Wu, mkosiwi gala malovi ga kukangamalisa mtima geiluwula Chapanga kuvya nyenye ndi vana vaki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">“Mwana vangu, koto kuvevesa mbunu wa Bambu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">kavili peakuhakalila kotoka kudenyeka mtima.<verse eid="HEB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6"/>Muni Bambu akumkita kila mweakumgana atama cheyiganikiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:6">na akumbuna kila mundu mweakumyidakila kuvya mwana waki.”<verse eid="HEB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7"/>Msindimalayi mbunu muni ndi muwuliwa, Chapanga akuvahengela ngati vana vaki. Wu, ndi mwana yoki mwangabuniwa na dadi waki? <verse eid="HEB 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8"/>Ngati mbuniwi lepi ngati vana vangi voha, hinu, nyenye lepi vana vaki, nambu vana va makunja. <verse eid="HEB 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9"/>Neju pa ago, tete tikuvatopesa vadadi na vanyina vitu vevativeliki hati pevakutibuna. Wu, chabwina lepi tikamyidakila njwe Dadi witu wa kunani muni tipewa wumi? <verse eid="HEB 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10"/>Vadadi vitu vevativeliki vatibunili magona gadebe, ngati chavawene vene yifwaya, nambu Chapanga akutibuna kwa kutitangatila tete muni tihotola kuvya vamsopi ngati mwene cheavili msopi. <verse eid="HEB 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11"/>Nambu hinu kubuniwa lepi chindu chakuhekesa nambu chindu cha kuvinisa mtima. Nambu mwanakandayi kubuniwa kwileta mabenu ga uteke na kutama kwa kumganisa Chapanga kwa vala vevawuliwi nayu.<verse eid="HEB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mawuliwu na Kuhakalila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12"/>Hinu, msopa makakala mawoko ginu gegalendili kangi mgolosa mafugamilu ginu gegalendili. <verse eid="HEB 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13"/>Muyendelela kugenda mu njila yeyivi selede, muni chila chechigogodili chikoto kulemaswa, nambu chilamayi.<verse eid="HEB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14"/>Mkangamalayi kutama kwa uteke na vandu voha na kutama kwa usopi, ndava muni kawaka mundu mweakumlola Bambu, ngati mundu mwenuyo lepi wa msopi. <verse eid="HEB 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15"/>Mjiyangalila neju mundu yeyoha akotoka kuyagisa ubwina wa Chapanga, akotoka kuvya mundu mweavi ngati liina livavanu lelitupuka na kuvaletela mang'ahiso na kuhalabisa wumi vandu vamahele. <verse eid="HEB 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16"/>Mujiyangalila pagati yinu akotoka kuvya mundu mkemi amala angamyopa Chapanga ngati Esau, mweagulisi uhali waki wa kuvya mwana mtumbulanu kwa mlyelu umonga. <verse eid="HEB 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17"/>Ndava mwimanya kuvya hati mwanakandahi peaganili kupata kangi mota kuhuma kwa dadi waki abeleliwi, muni avi lepi na fwasi ya kung'anamusa geagakitili, pamonga alondili kwa maholi.<verse eid="HEB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18"/>Nyenye mwahikili lepi kuchitumbi cha Sinai, ngati vandu va Isilaeli chevahikili. Chitumbi chechihotola kupamiswa kuni uyaka motu mulihundi lyohi litopa amala chimbungululu, <verse eid="HEB 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19"/>na lwami lwa lipenenga na vayuwini Chapanga ijova. Vala vevayuwini lwami lwenulo vayupili neju Chapanga akotoka kuyendela kulongela nawu lilovi lingi neju, <verse eid="HEB 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20"/>ndava vahotwili lepi kukangamala lilagizu lelawusiwi, “Hati chinyama ngati chikapamisa chitumbi chenichi chitovewa maganga mbaka kufwa.” <verse eid="HEB 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21"/>Na vindu vila vyawonikini ga kuyogofya neju, hati Musa ajovili, “Niyogopa na kuvagaya.”<verse eid="HEB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22"/>Nambu nyenye mhikili kuchitumbi cha Siyoni, pa muji wa Chapanga mweavi mumi. Mhikili Yelusalemu muji wa kunani kwa Chapanga pamonga na vamitumu vamahele vangavalangika va kunani kwa Chapanga veviselebuka. <verse eid="HEB 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23"/>Mhikili kumkonganiku wa msambi uvaha wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu ndi vachiveleku vatumbulanu va Chapanga na mahina gavi gayandikwi kunani. Mbwelili kwa Chapanga mweavi muhamula wa voha, na palongolo ya mipungu ya vandu vevamganisa Chapanga, vevakitiwi kuvya vakamilifu. <verse eid="HEB 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24"/>Nyenye mbwelili kwa Yesu mweavi mtepulanisi mu lilaganu la mupya, na ngasi yaki yeyinyunyusiwi yijova mambu gabwina kuliku yila ya Abeli.<verse eid="HEB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25"/>Hinu, mujiyangalila mkoto kubela kumuyuwanila mwenuyo mweijova na nyenye. Ngati Vaisilaeli vevabelili kumyuwanila Musa pamulima mweavajovili ujumbi kuhuma kwa Chapanga vasanguliwi lepi, wu tete tihola wuli kusanguliwa ngati tikabelayi kumyuwanila? <verse eid="HEB 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26"/>Lukumbi Chapanga pealongili kuchitumbi cha Sinai andendemisi mulima, nambu hinu alagini, ajovili, “Yati nindendemesa lepi mulima ndu, nambu mewawa kunani kwa Chapanga.” <verse eid="HEB 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27"/>Lilovi lenili, “Mala yimonga kangi” likutilangisa kuvya vindu vyoha vyeviwumbiki yati vindendemeswa na kuwusiwa muni visigalila vila vyangandendemeswa.<verse eid="HEB 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28"/>Hinu muni tipokili unkosi wanganyugusika timsengusa Chapanga, timfugamila kwa njila yeyikumganisa na kwa kuyogopa na kwa utopesa uvaha, <verse eid="HEB 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29"/>muni Chapanga witu ndi ngati motu weutinyisa njwe.<verse eid="HEB 12:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13"/>
  <para style="s">Wumi wa kumganisa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1"/>Muyendelela kuganana chiulongo. <verse eid="HEB 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2"/>Mkoto kukosiwa kuvapokela vayehe munyumba zinu, muni kwa kukita genago vandu vangi vavapokili vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga changamanya. <verse eid="HEB 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3"/>Mvakumbukayi vandu vevavi muchifungu ngati mukukungiwi nawu. Mewawa muvakumbukayi veving'aiswa ngati mung'aiswa pamonga nawu.<verse eid="HEB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4"/>Mambu ga kugega mdala giganikiwa kutopeswa na vandu voha, mgosi na mdala vayepa uhakasa, ndava muni Chapanga yati akuvahamula vagoni na vakemi.<verse eid="HEB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5"/>Mkoto kuvya vandu va kugana mashonga, mkola na vindu vyemuvili navyu. Chapanga mwene ajovili, “Katu yati nikukuleka lepi, amala kukutaga.” <verse eid="HEB 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6"/>Ndava yeniyo tihotola kujova kwa ukekesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">“Bambu ndi mtangatila wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">yati niyogopa lepi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">Wu, mundu yati akunikita kyani?”<verse eid="HEB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7"/>Mvakumbuka vachilongosi vinu vevavakokosili lilovi la Chapanga. Mhololela ndava mwenendu wa kutama kwavi myiga sadika yavi. <verse eid="HEB 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8"/>Yesu Kilisitu ndi yulayula golo, lelu na magono goha gangali mwishu. <verse eid="HEB 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9"/>Mkoto kukongiwa na mawuliwu gayehe gegakuvayagisa, mitima yinu yisopewayi makakala kwa ubwina wa Chapanga, lepi kwa mawuliwu ga vyakulya, ndava mawuliwu genago gavatangatili lepi vala vevagalandili.<verse eid="HEB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10"/>Tete tivii na lusanja lwa luteta lwa kuhinja hinyama na vala vevavili vakona vihengela mu lindanda la Vayawudi vabesiwi kulya vindu vyevivikiwi panani yaki. <verse eid="HEB 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11"/>Mteta Mkulu wa Vayawudi ipeleka ngasi ya hinyama Pandu Pamsopi Neju, ivika luteta ndava ya kumbudila Chapanga, nambu nyama za hinyama yeniyo yitinyiswa kuvala ya bwalu. <verse eid="HEB 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12"/>Ndava yeniyo mewawa Yesu mwene, muni ahotola kuvanyambisa vandu kwa ngasi yaki mwene, ang'aiswi na kufwa kuvala ya muji. <verse eid="HEB 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13"/>Hinu leka timuhambila kwenuko kuvala ya kambi, tigasindimala maligu ngati mwene cheasindimili maligu. <verse eid="HEB 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14"/>Muni pamulima apa tivii lepi na muji wa kusindimala, hinu tikuulindila muji wula weubwela. <verse eid="HEB 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15"/>Hinu kwa utangatila wa Yesu, tiyonjokesa kumpela Chapanga luteta lwa kumulumba, ndi ulumba weuwusiwa kwa milomo yeyisadika liina laki. <verse eid="HEB 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16"/>Mkoto kukosiwa kuhengelana gabwina na kutangatilana, muni luteta zenizi ndi zezimganisa Chapanga.<verse eid="HEB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17"/>Muvayidakila vachilongosi vinu na kukamula Malagizu gavi. Vene vakuvayunga wumi winu kilu na muhi, ndava yati vakumjovela Chapanga chevavahengili. Ngati mvayidakili yati vihenga lihengu lavi mu luheku, ngati muvayidakili lepi yati vihenga lihengu kwa ungolongondi, ndava chindu chenicho chikuvatangatila lepi.<verse eid="HEB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18"/>Mutiyupila. Tete tisadika njwe ngati mitima yitu yikutijovela lepi ngati tibudili, muni tigana kuhenga gabwina mu mambu magono goha. <verse eid="HEB 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19"/>Nikuvayupa neju mkangamala kuniyupila kwa Chapanga, muni aniwuyisa kanyata kwinu.<verse eid="HEB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kumuyupa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20"/>Chapanga wa uteke mweamyukisi Bambu witu Yesu, Mdimaji Mkulu wa mambelele kwa ngasi yeyilangisa lilaganu la chakaka magono goha gangali mwishu, <verse eid="HEB 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21"/>avakita nyenye kuvya mukangala mukila chindu chabwina chemwikita, muhotola kukita maganu gaki munjila ya Kilisitu ahenga gala gegakumganisa mwene mugati yinu. Ukulu uvya kwa Yesu Kilisitu magono na magono goha gangali mwishu! Ena.<verse eid="HEB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malovi ga kumalakisila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22"/>Hinu valongo, nikuvayupa neju mpokela ujumbi wenuwu wa kukangamalisa mtima. Yenivandikili mubalua yihupi. <verse eid="HEB 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23"/>Nigana kuvamanyisa kuvya mlongo witu Timoti amali kulekekeswa kuhuma muchifungu. Ngati akabwelayi hinu, yati nibwela nayu penibwela kwinu.<verse eid="HEB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24"/>Muvajambusa vachilongosi vinu voha pamonga na vandu voha va Chapanga! Vamsadika va Italia vakuvajambusa.<verse eid="HEB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25"/>Tikuvaganila mwavoha nyeye ubwina wa Chapanga.<verse eid="HEB 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13"/>
</usx>
